OL,3,AGerman chancellor greets Burnham with
OL,4,Amilitary honours on Berlin visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has travelled to Berlin to
OL,7,Fhold talks on tackling cyber-security
OL,8,Fthreats and sabotage with German
OL,9,FChancellor Friedrich Merz.
OL,11,FDowning Street said deeper co-operation
OL,12,Fin the face of rising hybrid threats
OL,13,Ffrom Russia would be high on the agenda
OL,14,Fduring Burnham's first official visit
OL,15,Fto Germany.
OL,17,FIntelligence services have warned of
OL,18,Frising threats, including last month
OL,19,Fwhen Germany accused Russia of
OL,20,Flaunching a drone fitted with
OL,21,Fexplosives at Leipzig/Halle Airport.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
