OL,3,AGerman chancellor greets Burnham with
OL,4,Amilitary honours on Berlin visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Berlin talks come after the prime
OL,7,Fminister told the Labour Party
OL,8,Fconference he wanted to set out options
OL,9,Ffor a closer relationship with the EU
OL,10,Flater this year, including the prospect
OL,11,Fof eventually rejoining the bloc.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
